jugEGM3LWTgkJT2ZJs4LFWC_BcrP9sC2x_5dGJsPZqHyabWaEmNAy1pqYNivavA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfscEoFOLDZEbkjIhL6XSeRok45g0hb7PwVL-DxlOYw41w&oe=69A2D33B"}, {"file_name": "VRShogiMates03cropped.png", "id": "337914812432265", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974774_337914815765598_1762840369253842605_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GczO0Y2FiIYQ7kNvwHslbB2&_nc_oc=AdnV9aMKb9glOm612Z2RbzieECbUGZnZ6r-x87xqbU4B413rYGqygn9dt_iAZunoOWI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu98zQ98E5px_JDPtOuHulMXnpy2PW20yAd4dNMr3F0cg&oe=69A2CDA1"}, {"file_name": "VRShogiMates04cropped.png", "id": "367552249204365", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031624_367552252537698_6058304213158592905_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u3y7qYqww2AQ7kNvwEq-mXx&_nc_oc=Adlk7XBGoDJfKGkl8Jc7KH4eWkVUgILG691JU2TIPAMND2fu53p4f9Nadk0I6Wu7-dc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfugWE3znQw4JD7cd8hPOjRhhvRPaaGNOjPOSxEj4h_XwA&oe=69A2FC25"}, {"file_name": "Chess cropped.png", "id": "902765531159168", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984463_902765534492501_3956653358745274292_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0FamIVfFFMoQ7kNvwFXQ6GH&_nc_oc=AdnIv-E1fPAnWPp6qFltdWp_lbixMaetr6_Zdchr37ZWUMKG7XdisVfvl2h4W3Gai14&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsuhLoXh9yt78Ipj4BYhEJ9jr9sRpMg8XYdWZJ_-RkNUw&oe=69A2F723"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerScreenshot cropped.png", "id": "717849803637730", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982545_717849806971063_8753740338935084738_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S-XbEJOg8s8Q7kNvwHyc-ML&_nc_oc=Adngg3o9lnTrXNFEQwhzAJ_t-a_1hYQeHsG3gCCs4IFhcLMnK36mdK9wTA9c2P-svuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsIk2Rl692hVQrbcy9vv21Gj4k1l2hfQOCAWhBqrsaJpg&oe=69A2D8BB"}, "display_name": "VRShogiMates", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to VRShogiMates, your gateway to a captivating virtual realm of classic board games! As a solo developer's passion project, this app delivers an unparalleled experience featuring Shogi, Chu Shogi, Chess, Xiangqi, and the unique Gungi from Hunter X Hunter.\n\nMultiplayer Mode:\nChallenge opponents worldwide in real-time or correspondence matches. Whether facing friends or discovering new adversaries, the global multiplayer functionality ensures a dynamic and engaging experience.\n\nHow to play:\nNew to these intricate games? No problem! VRShogiMates provides comprehensive rules, instructions, and a game record for each game type to help you learn. Explore the rules, grasp essential strategies, and elevate your skills!\n\nRegular Updates and Support:\nMy commitment doesn't end at launch. Expect continuous updates, bug fixes, performance enhancements, and exciting new features driven by valuable feedback from us.\n\nUnique Highlights:\nVenture into the unexplored VR realms of Shogi, Chu Shogi, Xiangqi, and Gungi - experiences currently not offered by any other VR app on the market! The last game type, Gungi, brings a touch of fantasy to your gaming repertoire. It\u2019s refreshingly different from other board games, check it out!\n\nEmbark on this virtual journey, where tradition meets innovation, and every move is a step towards victory. VRShogiMates is not just a game; it's a portal to a world where strategy, competition, and community converge. Join us and redefine your board gaming experience!", "short_description": "Dive into the immersive world of board games with VRShogiMates! Play Shogi, Chu Shogi, Chess, Xiangqi, and Gungi in a stunning virtual environment. Challenge friends globally in real-time or turn-based multiplayer. Learn the rules for all the games, while enjoying regular updates for an ever-evolving gaming experience.\n\nInternet connection is required to play. (For now)\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "develop